f questions to ask a celebrity.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le15ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le15ob04re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le15ob04re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn9le15ob04re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: I'm here with Bip Fiddle, famous ... <br /><span class= \"strong\"> Bip</span>: Famous? I don't know about that. Infamous, maybe.<br /><span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Well, let's go with notable, then. Does that work?<br /><span class= \"strong\"> Bip</span>: Some might say more notorious than notable, but sure, whatever floats your boat, baby.<br /><span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: My name is Sally Davis. You can call me Ms. Davis or Sally, but definitely not baby.<br /><span class= \"strong\">Bip</span>: Alright, Sally. If I'd known you were such a stickler, I would've been more careful. The last thing I need is more bad press.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn9le15ob04re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\">Sally</span>: Has the media been tough on you?<br /><span class= \"strong\">Bip</span>: Have they? They reported that I missed a concert because I went on a three-day bender.<br /><span class= \"strong\">Sally</span>: And? Was it true?<br /><span class= \"strong\">Bip</span>: Of course it was true, but they didn't have to report it. Anyway, it was a two-day bender, not three.<br /><span class= \"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, so they sensationalized it, did they? <br /><span class= \"strong\">Bip</span>: They could've focused on the positive. Like how I sang at the children's hospital ... <br /><span class= \"strong\">Sally</span>: As part of your court-mandated probation, if I recall ... <br />", "time": "29500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn9le15ob04re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Bip</span>: Still, I could've just skipped it, like I did that concert. <br /><span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Well, this doesn't sound like bad press to me. It sounds like your bad attitude might've been a factor in their reporting.<br /><span class= \"strong\"> Bip</span>: So, now you're on their  side?<br /><span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Well I am a blogger. We're press too you know ... <br /><span class= \"strong\"> Bip</span>: Blogger? I thought you were a dog walker! I must've got my schedule mixed up. I really need to fire my publicist. Bye Sandy!<br /><span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: For the last time, it's Sally!<br />", "time": "58500", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}